{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>今日（24日）凌晨4時39分，警方接獲安定邨定泰樓一名男子報案，指其9歲女兒在單位內情緒激動，並手持利刀；他上前奪刀制止期間，疑不慎傷及女兒胸口。</p><p>救援人員接報到場，女童神智清醒，由救護車送往屯門醫院治理；案中父親則被帶返警署調查，案件暫列作「傷人」處理。</p><figure><img alt=\"女童被送到屯門醫院治理。（資料圖片）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261012/1186262531635679232321875.jpeg/JNTwJMP0IHBhIMy4-eCh2GbJpVJItzWyoxkHLaMZBy0\"/><figcaption>女童被送到屯門醫院治理。（資料圖片）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"安定邨定泰樓。（資料圖片）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/1658395/org/fb9fcf43f1bb376f488f6e9a69b62a8a.jpg/jXbsgZkSvGb_Ie9ZRaAe9zjq5xuLPX9LT4F3xU-Bd8U\"/><figcaption>安定邨定泰樓。（資料圖片）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-24T00:44:22.561354+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":161,"images":2,"source":"HK01 突發","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-24T00:28:46+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-24T01:58:25.917456+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-24T00:38:34.438869+00:00","content_hash":"7dffef060d2bcbdc2d3910c84977ce397bff2c5a9e4c64206cc3d8a33902544d","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}